<view class="page dev-page">
  <view class="dev-head">
    <text class="dev-title">开发自检</text>
    <text class="dev-sub">Mock 数据层连通性检查 · v{{version}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card table-card">
    <view class="table-row">
      <view class="table-info">
        <text class="table-label">当前桌号（调试）</text>
        <text class="table-value">{{tableName ? tableName + ' · ' + tableArea : '未设置'}}</text>
      </view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{tableOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{tableIndex}}" bindchange="onTablePick">
        <view class="table-pick">选择桌号</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <text class="table-hint">没有真实二维码时，用这里代替扫码，效果与扫码带入一致；只接受配置里启用中的桌号，正式环境仍以桌面二维码为准。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card table-card">
    <view class="table-row">
      <view class="table-info">
        <text class="table-label">老板管理后台（演示）</text>
        <text class="table-value">{{ownerText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="table-pick" bindtap="onAdminLogin">去登录</view>
    </view>
    <text class="table-hint">演示口令 8888。正式版必须由云函数校验管理员身份，前端入口与口令都不构成安全边界。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card check-list">
    <view class="check-item" wx:for="{{checks}}" wx:key="name">
      <view class="check-dot {{item.ok ? 'is-ok' : 'is-fail'}}"></view>
      <text class="check-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="check-detail">{{item.detail}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="check-empty" wx:if="{{!checks.length}}">检查中…</view>
  </view>

  <view class="dev-actions">
    <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="runChecks">重新检测</button>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost reset-btn" bindtap="onReset">重置演示数据</button>
  </view>

  <view class="dev-note">
    <text>本页仅在开发版「我的」中显示；正式发布后不会出现。</text>
  </view>
</view>